# Public-repository allowlist
#
# Keep local observations, processing code, intermediate products, reports,
# notebooks, SAGE metadata, and previous site snapshots out of Git history.
# Only the repository documentation and the generated GitHub Pages tree are
# intentionally publishable.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/docs/**

# Local/editor metadata and Python files inside the public tree must remain
# private even if they are accidentally copied there later.
docs/.DS_Store
docs/**/.DS_Store
docs/__pycache__/
docs/**/__pycache__/
docs/*.py
docs/*.py[cod]
docs/**/*.py
docs/**/*.py[cod]
